"__SITE_BASE__/academics">Academics</a></li><li><a href="__SITE_BASE__/admissions">Admissions</a></li><li><a href="__SITE_BASE__/gallery">Gallery</a></li><li><a href="__SITE_BASE__/news">News</a></li><li><a href="__SITE_BASE__/contact">Contact</a></li></ul></nav><nav aria-label="Language"><ul class="langs"><li><a href="__SITE_BASE__/?lang=en" lang="en" aria-current="page">English</a></li><li><a href="__SITE_BASE__/?lang=hi" lang="hi" hreflang="hi">हिन्दी</a></li><li><a href="__SITE_BASE__/?lang=mr" lang="mr" hreflang="mr">मराठी</a></li></ul></nav></div></header><main id="main"><div class="hero band"><div class="wrap"><p class="big">Learning by the river</p></div></div><section id="about" aria-labelledby="h-about"><div class="wrap"><h2 id="h-about">About us</h2><p>A school by the river.</p><p>We teach &lt;b&gt;everyone&lt;/b&gt; &amp; we mean it.</p><div class="principal"><h3>From the principal</h3><blockquote><p>Welcome to our school.</p><cite>ZZ Head</cite></blockquote></div><p class="more"><a href="__SITE_BASE__/about">More about us</a></p></div></section><section id="numbers" aria-labelledby="h-numbers"><div class="wrap"><h2 id="h-numbers">At a glance</h2><ul class="numbers"><li><span class="v">1,234</span><span class="l">Students enrolled</span></li><li><span class="v">56</span><span class="l">Teaching staff</span></li><li><span class="v">93%</span><span class="l">Attendance this month</span></li><li><span class="v">CBSE · 1130456</span><span class="l">Board and affiliation</span></li><li><span class="v">36</span><span class="l">Years since founding</span></li></ul><p class="asof">Figures as of 15 October 2026.</p></div></section><section id="news" aria-labelledby="h-news"><div class="wrap"><h2 id="h-news">News</h2><ul class="news"><li><article class="pic"><img src="/api/files/f-news?w=640" alt="Children racing" loading="lazy"><div><h3>Sports day</h3><time datetime="2026-10-01">1 October 2026</time><p>Races and a &lt;script&gt;alert(1)&lt;/script&gt; tug of war.</p></div></article></li></ul><p class="more"><a href="__SITE_BASE__/news">All the news</a></p></div></section><section id="gallery" aria-labelledby="h-gallery"><div class="wrap"><h2 id="h-gallery">Gallery</h2><ul class="gallery"><li><img src="/api/files/f-gallery?w=640" alt="The prize table" loading="lazy"></li></ul><p class="more"><a href="__SITE_BASE__/gallery">All the pictures</a></p></div></section><section id="admissions" aria-labelledby="h-admissions"><div class="wrap"><h2 id="h-admissions">Admissions</h2><p>Forms open in January.</p><p class="more"><a href="__SITE_BASE__/admissions">How to apply</a></p></div></section><section id="contact" aria-labelledby="h-contact"><div class="wrap"><h2 id="h-contact">Contact</h2><dl class="contact"><dt>Address</dt><dd>1 River Road, Pune, Maharashtra, 411001</dd><dt>Phone</dt><dd><a href="tel:+912012345678">+91 20 1234 5678</a></dd><dt>Email</dt><dd><a href="mailto:office@zz-river.test">office@zz-river.test</a></dd><dt>Office hours</dt><dd>Monday to Saturday, 9 to 4</dd></dl><p><a href="https://maps.example.test/river" rel="noopener">Open the map</a></p><p class="more"><a href="__SITE_BASE__/contact">Contact us</a></p></div></section></main><footer><div class="wrap"><p>ZZ River School · 1 River Road, Pune, Maharashtra, 411001</p><p><a href="https://app.example.test">Built with Shalaghar</a></p></div></footer></body></html>"`;

